        "always be rebuilt on its own. To reproduce (scratch lives in .demo-build/,",
        "which is gitignored):",
        "  node run-demo.mjs .demo-build/record.json          # record the mock app",
        "  node src/lib/cinematic3d/render.mjs .demo-build/shot1.json 3",
        "  ffmpeg -y -i text.mp4 -i .demo-build/shot1.mp4 -filter_complex \\",
        "    \"[1:v]setpts=PTS+6.33/TB[s];[0:v][s]overlay=0:0:enable='between(t,6.33,10.33)'\" \\",
        "    -c:v libx264 -crf 17 -pix_fmt yuv420p -r 60 doorstep.mp4",
        "",
        "The 3D shot is laptop-punch-reveal on a black set, which cuts cleanly",
        "against this scene's dark ground. Render it at the SAME width/height/fps",
        "as 'video' above or the overlay will not line up."
